      "description": "Model accepted VICE transport state and image eligibility before deriving tape sense or recording eligibility. Preserve the distinction between device sense state, each machine input port, and tape read-pulse interrupt wiring. Recording consumes ordered clocked write-line transitions and retains the native gap, image-position, and write-failure behavior through the managed adapter.",
